    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπτήν</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆνος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτηνός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unfledged, callow,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπτῆσι νεοσσοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.323
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπτῆνα τυτθόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					1291
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unwinged,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτοί</span>”
