					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					687
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεζοῖς τε καὶ ἀπτῆσι</span>
				(sc.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴοις</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				276a
			</span></i>.</div>
